#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0058-B expect=skipped domain=VS
#note "Scope.Domains.Include is DM only, so VS is out of PMDA-SD0058-B scope: VS is checked by the parent PMDA-SD0058. VSCUSTOM is a sponsor variable in no model list and in no grant, so the check would report it if the Include scope were dropped."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library model-column-order VS STUDYID DOMAIN USUBJID VSSEQ VSTESTCD VSTEST VSORRES
dataset VS
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col VSSEQ type=Num
col VSTESTCD type=Char
col VSTEST type=Char
col VSORRES type=Char
col VSCUSTOM type=Char
---
S1 | VS | 001 | 1 | SYSBP | Systolic Blood Pressure | 120 | X
---
